WEBVTT

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:36.910 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.950 line:0%
[Episode 38]

00:01:40.880 --> 00:01:42.680 line:0%
For your sake,

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:45.350 line:0%
I won't be too hard on them.

00:01:57.520 --> 00:01:59.040 line:0%
I'll give you three days

00:02:01.070 --> 00:02:02.600 line:0%
to think it over carefully.

00:02:09.740 --> 00:02:11.140 line:0%
Take care, Lord Lai.

00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:13.690 line:0%
Nerd!

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:17.220 line:0%
Nerd.

00:02:30.490 --> 00:02:31.820 line:0%
Stop crying, Chuichui.

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:33.920 line:0%
I'm okay.

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:37.510 line:0%
I'm alright.

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:42.320 line:0%
Xing.

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:44.780 line:0%
You can't keep skipping meals.

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:46.730 line:0%
Open the door.

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:48.800 line:0%
I've brought you some soup.

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:51.200 line:0%
If you have any grievances,

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:52.400 line:0%
once you've eaten,

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.800 line:0%
I'll accompany you to storm the Shen's Mansion.

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:55.680 line:0%
I, your mother,

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:57.640 line:0%
have nearly died once before.

00:02:57.879 --> 00:02:59.160 line:0%
Whether it's the White Ghost

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:00.440 line:0%
or the White King of Hell,

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:01.280 line:0%
I

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:04.340 line:0%
will surely scratch him until he cries for his parents.

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:12.640 line:0%
My dear daughter.

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:15.440 line:0%
I know you're suffering inside.

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:17.000 line:0%
But as women,

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:19.120 line:0%
we must be nourished

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:20.600 line:0%
by love and appreciation.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.800 line:0%
He's a man who doesn't know how to appreciate you.

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:23.960 line:0%
What use is he?

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:26.800 line:0%
We can't let every little thing

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:28.240 line:0%
knock us down, can we?

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:29.840 line:0%
I promise you,

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.520 line:0%
I'll definitely find you someone

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:33.080 line:0%
who will cherish and protect you,

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:35.720 line:0%
a handsome young man who will listen to your every word.

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:36.850 line:0%
How does that sound?

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:45.640 line:0%
Handsome young man?

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:50.200 line:0%
I'm here to check on Yan Xing.

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:53.320 line:0%
Xing!

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:54.160 line:0%
It's me,

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:55.040 line:0%
Pan Chi.

00:03:58.200 --> 00:03:59.000 line:0%
Xing!

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:11.800 line:0%
Xing has been keeping to herself lately.

00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:13.730 line:0%
She won't open the door for anyone.

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:18.160 line:0%
Come in.

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:32.280 line:0%
So... She's taken my words to heart?

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:42.760 line:0%
First Madam!

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:45.180 line:0%
Ms. Jin.

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:47.160 line:0%
Did a male outsider

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:48.720 line:0%
just enter Xing's room?

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:52.360 line:0%
First Madam, what nonsense are you talking about?

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:54.140 line:0%
What do you mean by "male outsider"?

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:56.810 line:0%
Our Xing is a female official in the Ministry of Justice,

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:59.200 line:0%
not a s... Secluded lady in the inner chambers.

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:01.080 line:0%
Of course she needs to meet guests

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:02.820 line:0%
and handle official business.

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:06.070 line:0%
Xing is virtuous indeed.

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:07.880 line:0%
Although Xing's not my biological child,

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:09.790 line:0%
I watched her grow up.

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:10.790 line:0%
Everyone knows that.

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:12.820 line:0%
Before, when she married Shen Du,

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:14.720 line:0%
I was also really worried.

00:05:14.740 --> 00:05:15.680 line:0%
I also hoped

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:17.410 line:0%
she could have a good marriage.

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:18.240 line:0%
Now that

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:20.400 line:0%
she's divorced and returned to the Yan family,

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:21.480 line:0%
she should at least consider

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:23.340 line:0%
the reputation of the Yan family.

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:24.880 line:0%
What do you mean by that?

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:26.280 line:0%
Don't you know?

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:27.960 line:0%
The entire Yan family

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:29.920 line:0%
is now being watched by the Imperial Investigation Department.

00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:31.380 line:0%
People outside are saying

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:33.330 line:0%
that the Yan family's daughter

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:35.700 line:0%
has become a discarded woman.

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:39.240 line:0%
Now, if male outsiders come and go as they please,

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:40.280 line:0%
I'm afraid people will think

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:42.360 line:0%
that our Yan family is not strict in discipline.

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:43.280 line:0%
First Madam!

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:45.240 line:0%
Obviously, it was Xing

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:45.880 line:0%
who didn't want that

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:47.680 line:0%
ungrateful Shen Du anymore.

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:49.200 line:0%
How dare you call our Xing

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:50.440 line:0%
a discarded woman?

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:52.200 line:0%
Let me tell you, First Madam!

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:53.920 line:0%
I've put up with you for a long time.

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:55.200 line:0%
I'll fight you, I will!

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:56.320 line:0%
I only have good intentions.

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:58.180 line:0%
What do you mean good intentions?

00:05:58.600 --> 00:06:00.360 line:0%
Stop fighting! Stop fighting!

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:01.690 line:0%
Come on, stop fighting!

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:03.200 line:0%
Stop it!

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:05.320 line:0%
What a family misfortune.

00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:07.220 line:0%
Both of you, stop it right now!

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:08.880 line:0%
Xing.

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:11.640 line:0%
I'm only being kind, yet you...

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:13.040 line:0%
You... You be quiet too!

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:20.840 line:0%
Mother. Madam.

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:22.560 line:0%
Please stop arguing.

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:27.600 line:0%
Father.

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:29.150 line:0%
We need to go out for a while.

00:06:34.690 --> 00:06:35.760 line:0%
Ru!

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:37.640 line:0%
-You're talking nonsense!
-Look!

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:38.740 line:0%
Isn't that a male outsider?

00:06:38.740 --> 00:06:39.800 line:0%
Stop fighting!

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:40.959 line:0%
You're still trying to deny it?

00:06:40.959 --> 00:06:41.840 line:0%
Stop fighting!

00:06:42.760 --> 00:06:43.560 line:0%
Honey!

00:06:43.640 --> 00:06:44.880 line:0%
Why are you hitting me now?

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:45.800 line:0%
Look at her!

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:47.720 line:0%
Are you going to do something about her or not?

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:49.600 line:0%
Be gentler. You hit my face!

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:16.080 line:0%
You are...

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:18.640 line:0%
You're from Tongming House?

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:19.920 line:0%
Are you Yan Xing?

00:07:25.450 --> 00:07:26.400 line:0%
Turn around the corner ahead,

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:27.280 line:0%
and there's a small alley.

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:28.280 line:0%
You can leave through there.

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:29.240 line:0%
No one will know.

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:30.860 line:0%
Why are you helping us?

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:32.760 line:0%
For the sake of sisterhood,

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:34.290 line:0%
and for the virtue of women.

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:35.959 line:0%
Thanks a lot.

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:37.160 line:0%
Thanks a lot.

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:38.100 line:0%
Hurry up and go.

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:45.600 line:0%
They're here.

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:46.720 line:0%
Sister.

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:47.360 line:0%
Hurry, hurry.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:48.080 line:0%
Xing.

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:49.560 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:50.880 line:0%
Hurry up.

00:08:02.840 --> 00:08:04.280 line:0%
You're finally here.

00:08:04.280 --> 00:08:06.740 line:0%
I was worried you wouldn't be able to get out.

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:08.120 line:0%
Fortunately,

00:08:08.280 --> 00:08:09.340 line:0%
it was a close call.

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:10.760 line:0%
So White Ghost really

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:12.220 line:0%
teamed up with Lai Luozhi?

00:08:26.120 --> 00:08:27.240 line:0%
From now on,

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:30.060 line:0%
I will have no more dealings with Shen Du.

00:08:32.709 --> 00:08:33.520 line:0%
How did you manage to evade

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:34.880 line:0%
the eyes and ears of the Imperial Investigation Department?

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:36.589 line:0%
You haven't left the mansion for days,

00:08:36.589 --> 00:08:37.349 line:0%
which has made Lai Luozhi

00:08:37.349 --> 00:08:38.680 line:0%
lower their guard a bit.

00:08:39.770 --> 00:08:40.859 line:0%
It seems Chuichui

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:42.349 line:0%
understood my letter.

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:47.460 line:0%
Salt has eyes and ears.

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:49.300 line:0%
Three days by the pond.

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:53.750 line:0%
[Salt has eyes and ears. Three days by the pond.]

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:52.360 line:0%
It means there are Lai Luozhi's spies

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:54.490 line:0%
monitoring around the Yan's Mansion.

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:55.620 line:0%
It says to

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:57.400 line:0%
meet you at the pawnshop three days later.

00:08:57.400 --> 00:08:58.200 line:0%
Lu Chuichui

00:08:58.280 --> 00:08:59.880 line:0%
is already waiting for us at the pawnshop.

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:00.920 line:0%
Let's find a way

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:02.770 line:0%
to bypass the hidden sentries.

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:06.610 line:0%
[Salt has eyes and ears. Three days by the pond.]

00:09:18.430 --> 00:09:20.120 line:0%
Gift to Zhanxin.

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:22.040 line:0%
So she is

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:24.770 line:0%
the sister of Kuang Zhanxin from Tongming House.

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:26.680 line:0%
Did she help me today

00:09:27.070 --> 00:09:28.490 line:0%
because she thought

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:31.160 line:0%
I had cleared Kuang Zhanxin's name?

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:32.440 line:0%
Investigating cases and clearing names

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:34.240 line:0%
was never about seeking rewards.

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:35.370 line:0%
What we gained today

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:37.000 line:0%
is all due to people's kind intentions

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:38.130 line:0%
and mutual support.

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:44.600 line:0%
[Gift to Zhanxin]

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:47.360 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:50.490 line:0%
Nowadays, Lai Luozhi has absolute power.

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:52.120 line:0%
I've come up with an idea.

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:54.240 line:0%
Why don't you and Jiang Langxing

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:55.680 line:0%
leave Xiang'an for a while

00:09:55.680 --> 00:09:56.920 line:0%
and lay low for a bit?

00:10:00.520 --> 00:10:02.560 line:0%
I pretended to go along with him yesterday.

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:05.090 line:0%
He should be letting his guard down recently.

00:10:05.280 --> 00:10:06.560 line:0%
We can take this opportunity

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:07.440 line:0%
to run away.

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:10.470 line:0%
Xing.

00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:12.640 line:0%
Why don't you leave here with us?

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:16.440 line:0%
I need to stay here.

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:17.280 line:0%
Why?

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:20.920 line:0%
Don't tell me you still can't let go of

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:22.160 line:0%
that White Ghost.

00:10:29.130 --> 00:10:30.390 line:0%
Take care of yourself.

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:33.440 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:34.880 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:35.720 line:0%
Father.

00:10:38.160 --> 00:10:40.000 line:0%
It's your first time traveling far from home.

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:40.900 line:0%
Remember,

00:10:41.360 --> 00:10:43.870 line:0%
nothing is as good as gold.

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:45.280 line:0%
I've

00:10:45.280 --> 00:10:46.960 line:0%
prepared some extra gold for you.

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:48.920 line:0%
It'll be convenient for your journey.

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:50.450 line:0%
Come on, put it on your back.

00:10:51.890 --> 00:10:53.400 line:0%
Be careful on the road.

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:55.040 line:0%
Be good.

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:56.240 line:0%
Father.

00:11:02.520 --> 00:11:04.180 line:0%
Alright, be good.

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:15.990 line:0%
[Lu's Pawnshop]

00:11:30.720 --> 00:11:31.520 line:0%
Nerd!

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:34.720 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:38.190 line:0%
It's alright. It's alright.

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:46.600 line:0%
Nerd.

00:11:47.280 --> 00:11:48.360 line:0%
For my sake,

00:11:48.550 --> 00:11:50.140 line:0%
you have to leave Xiang'an

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:52.660 line:0%
and give up your identity as a constable.

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:54.870 line:0%
Do you feel any regret,

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:56.800 line:0%
or think it's a pity?

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:04.290 line:0%
As long as you're by my side,

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:05.720 line:0%
anywhere

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:07.200 line:0%
can be a place

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:09.860 line:0%
where I, Jiang Langxing, can make a difference.

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:13.920 line:0%
Right.

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:15.800 line:0%
From now on,

00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:17.080 line:0%
we'll be a pair of

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:20.160 line:0%
righteous heroes, punishing evil and upholding justice in the martial world.

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:20.960 line:0%
Sure.

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:27.440 line:0%
Thanks a lot.

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:33.920 line:0%
Take care.

00:12:34.840 --> 00:12:35.640 line:0%
Farewell.

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:37.970 line:0%
Let me take that.

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:52.480 line:0%
What do you mean she's gone!

00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:54.790 line:0%
I am incompetent, My Lord.

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:55.760 line:0%
Miss Lu and Jiang Langxing

00:12:55.760 --> 00:12:57.400 line:0%
have indeed disappeared without a trace.

00:12:57.400 --> 00:12:59.020 line:0%
I'm afraid they've already left Xiang'an.

00:12:59.020 --> 00:13:00.200 line:0%
Then go out of the city

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:01.280 line:0%
and search everywhere!

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:02.640 line:0%
Even if you have to dig three feet into the ground,

00:13:02.640 --> 00:13:03.960 line:0%
you must find her and bring her to me!

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:04.690 line:0%
Yes, My Lord!

00:13:10.530 --> 00:13:12.490 line:0%
She was deceiving you all along.

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:13.720 line:0%
A woman like that,

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:15.200 line:0%
why do you still care about her?

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:15.840 line:0%
Get out!

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:17.330 line:0%
All of you, get out!

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:27.800 line:0%
Dongzhou Garrison,

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:36.580 line:0%
[Lai's Mansion]

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:29.120 line:0%
here to pay respects to Lord Lai.

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:32.360 line:0%
The prefect of Yangle City requests an audience with Lord Lai.

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:35.420 line:0%
The commander of Yuanmeng City is here to pay respects.

00:13:44.560 --> 00:13:45.360 line:0%
My Lord.

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:46.720 line:0%
The carriages of noble families

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:47.600 line:0%
who have come to pledge allegiance in recent days

00:13:47.600 --> 00:13:48.640 line:0%
have blocked the streets in front of the mansion

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:49.720 line:0%
so tightly that not even water can pass through.

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:50.680 line:0%
They won't leave even if we try to drive them away.

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:51.400 line:0%
Now,

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:52.480 line:0%
70 percent of the officials

00:13:52.480 --> 00:13:54.160 line:0%
have already pledged allegiance to you.

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:57.620 line:0%
Scholars alone won't be enough for me to achieve great things.

00:13:58.640 --> 00:14:00.200 line:0%
Any movements from those local military leaders?

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:01.160 line:0%
The commanders of local garrison troops of various regions

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:02.520 line:0%
have sent their calling cards,

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:03.320 line:0%
expressing

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:04.840 line:0%
their desire to take the opportunity of the Grand Court Assembly

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:06.880 line:0%
to come to Xiang'an and pay their respects to you, My Lord.

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:07.680 line:0%
Good.

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:10.490 line:0%
Of the six garrison commanders,

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:13.020 line:0%
four have already pledged their allegiance.

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:15.970 line:0%
The remaining two are not to be feared.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:21.300 line:0%
The second day of the second lunar month.

00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:23.190 line:0%
It seems

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:26.840 line:0%
the second day of the second lunar month

00:14:27.290 --> 00:14:28.730 line:0%
is an auspicious day.

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:32.680 line:0%
Moths to a flame!

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:34.480 line:0%
Born at dawn, dead by dusk!

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:36.360 line:0%
Not entering the cycle of reincarnation!

00:14:36.360 --> 00:14:37.920 line:0%
Immortal reincarnation!

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:39.820 line:0%
The Purple Star has appeared.

00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:41.500 line:0%
A blessing for the Cang State.

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:43.060 line:0%
Sacred grace has arrived.

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:44.960 line:0%
The world belongs to Luozhi!

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:46.420 line:0%
Sacred grace has arrived!

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:48.120 line:0%
The world belongs to Luozhi!

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:49.720 line:0%
Sacred grace has arrived!

00:14:49.760 --> 00:14:51.610 line:0%
The world belongs to Luozhi!

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:55.360 line:0%
Xing.

00:14:58.880 --> 00:14:59.680 line:0%
Pan.

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:03.360 line:0%
The Imperial Investigation Department

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:04.000 line:0%
hasn't yet withdrawn

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.160 line:0%
their surveillance on the Yan's Mansion.

00:15:05.160 --> 00:15:06.120 line:0%
Coming out like this,

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:07.200 line:0%
aren't you afraid of being implicated?

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:08.960 line:0%
If Lai Luozhi wants to implicate me,

00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:10.680 line:0%
would it matter if I come out once or twice?

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:12.200 line:0%
I'm just accompanying you on a walk to take your mind off things.

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:13.480 line:0%
What's wrong with that?

00:15:13.480 --> 00:15:14.200 line:0%
I heard that

00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:15.750 line:0%
the Imperial Security Bureau and the Imperial Investigation Department

00:15:15.750 --> 00:15:16.880 line:0%
are now in cahoots.

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:20.700 line:0%
From now on, I'm afraid

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:24.290 line:0%
there will be no more just officials in Xiang'an.

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:27.040 line:0%
Being immersed in rumors

00:15:27.080 --> 00:15:28.200 line:0%
can be harmful to your health.

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:30.260 line:0%
Why don't we go find some fun instead?

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:42.040 line:0%
Madam?

00:15:42.320 --> 00:15:43.680 line:0%
Yan... Director Yan.

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:45.480 line:0%
Director Yan.

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:48.080 line:0%
I remember you claimed to be

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:49.280 line:0%
fully dedicated to your official duties.

00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:49.920 line:0%
How come nowadays I can't find you

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:51.450 line:0%
at the Ministry of Justice,

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:53.210 line:0%
but instead see you here

00:15:53.280 --> 00:15:55.280 line:0%
flirting with someone irrelevant?

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:57.440 line:0%
Lord Shen.

00:15:58.080 --> 00:15:59.680 line:0%
Xing has finished her shift.

00:15:59.880 --> 00:16:01.280 line:0%
She's under the Ministry of Justice.

00:16:01.280 --> 00:16:03.560 line:0%
Who she talks to and who she associates with

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:05.720 line:0%
is not under the jurisdiction of the Imperial Security Bureau, I'm afraid.

00:16:05.720 --> 00:16:06.720 line:0%
Among all the officials in the court of the Cang State,

00:16:06.720 --> 00:16:08.960 line:0%
except for the Imperial Investigation Department,

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:09.800 line:0%
who dares not to listen to

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:11.280 line:0%
what the Imperial Security Bureau says?

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:12.080 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:16:12.760 --> 00:16:14.490 line:0%
Look at what you've become now.

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:16.280 line:0%
The common people are saying,

00:16:16.060 --> 00:16:20.190 line:0%
[Ministry of Justice]

00:16:16.880 --> 00:16:18.960 line:0%
"The Black and White Kings of Hell walk side by side.

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:20.720 line:0%
From now on, the mortal world is a purgatory."

00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:21.920 line:0%
Do you think

00:16:21.920 --> 00:16:23.240 line:0%
being avoided by everyone like a venomous snake

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:24.960 line:0%
is something to be proud of?

00:16:25.680 --> 00:16:26.480 line:0%
Do you still remember

00:16:26.480 --> 00:16:27.760 line:0%
the words you once said

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:29.220 line:0%
and the vows you once made?

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:36.680 line:0%
People

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:39.440 line:0%
all change.

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:45.840 line:0%
Xing.

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:48.960 line:0%
Don't waste your words on this kind of person.

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:49.760 line:0%
Let's go.

00:16:57.930 --> 00:17:00.540 line:0%
[Ministry of Justice]

00:17:08.389 --> 00:17:09.200 line:0%
Xing.

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:11.520 line:0%
Sit here and rest for a while.

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:12.520 line:0%
I'll be right out.

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:32.360 line:0%
Xing.

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:34.120 line:0%
Do you remember

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:35.120 line:0%
this is where

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:36.520 line:0%
we first met?

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:42.000 line:0%
The inversion of shadows,

00:17:42.190 --> 00:17:43.720 line:0%
the intersection of light,

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:45.270 line:0%
and the creation of focus and shadows are what is known

00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:46.730 line:0%
as the principle of focus.

00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:48.820 line:0%
This is what you taught me.

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:55.800 line:0%
From the moment we first met,

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:57.080 line:0%
I've pictured

00:17:57.080 --> 00:17:58.970 line:0%
what you would become in the future.

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:00.240 line:0%
You would become

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:02.720 line:0%
a female official who speaks for the people,

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:04.180 line:0%
leaving a lasting legacy.

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:08.900 line:0%
Now, only you

00:18:10.670 --> 00:18:13.140 line:0%
still believe in the aspirations in my heart.

00:18:13.140 --> 00:18:14.100 line:0%
In my eyes,

00:18:15.220 --> 00:18:17.350 line:0%
you've never been someone's daughter

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:18.810 line:0%
or someone's wife.

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:23.680 line:0%
You are Yan Xing, a female official of the Ministry of Justice,

00:18:23.680 --> 00:18:24.610 line:0%
the most skilled

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:26.800 line:0%
crime-solver in the Cang State,

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:29.960 line:0%
and more importantly, my soulmate.

00:18:30.840 --> 00:18:31.800 line:0%
I only hope

00:18:32.160 --> 00:18:34.120 line:0%
that you can fulfill your ambitions

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:36.240 line:0%
in the Ministry of Justice freely and happily.

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:37.160 line:0%
I'll definitely

00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:38.690 line:0%
stand silently behind you.

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:43.910 line:0%
But unfortunately,

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:46.070 line:0%
everything has changed now.

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:48.290 line:0%
The court is full of undercurrents,

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:50.490 line:0%
with no fairness or justice to speak of.

00:18:51.280 --> 00:18:52.730 line:0%
You mediate within it,

00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:54.400 line:0%
only to be burdened by it.

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:56.290 line:0%
The world is vast,

00:18:56.600 --> 00:18:57.360 line:0%
and there are many paths of life

00:18:57.360 --> 00:18:58.890 line:0%
besides being an official.

00:19:04.320 --> 00:19:05.640 line:0%
Perhaps you're right.

00:19:47.840 --> 00:19:49.440 line:0%
With our combined strength,

00:19:49.480 --> 00:19:51.210 line:0%
even if we travel the four seas,

00:19:51.240 --> 00:19:52.720 line:0%
we can right wrongs

00:19:52.850 --> 00:19:54.580 line:0%
and clear unjust accusations.

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:55.800 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:19:56.520 --> 00:19:58.250 line:0%
Are you willing to come with me,

00:19:58.440 --> 00:20:00.380 line:0%
escape this land of right and wrong,

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:02.910 line:0%
and journey to the ends of the earth together?

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:37.080 line:0%
If you're willing,

00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:39.920 line:0%
I can

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:41.040 line:0%
take the lives

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:43.100 line:0%
of that despicable couple right now.

00:21:41.960 --> 00:21:43.480 line:0%
If you let go now,

00:21:44.680 --> 00:21:46.720 line:0%
I'm afraid she'll never come back.

00:21:47.400 --> 00:21:48.200 line:0%
Perfect.

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:51.440 line:0%
It's better not to have them in my sight.

00:21:53.800 --> 00:21:54.720 line:0%
Rest assured.

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:57.680 line:0%
I will have the Ministry of Justice clear the Shen family's name.

00:21:57.680 --> 00:21:59.880 line:0%
It's just a matter of filing a petition.

00:22:09.520 --> 00:22:12.380 line:0%
Is there anything else you need to tell your family?

00:22:14.240 --> 00:22:15.880 line:0%
I've already told my family

00:22:16.000 --> 00:22:18.080 line:0%
that I'm going out to travel for a while.

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:19.440 line:0%
They highly approve,

00:22:20.120 --> 00:22:21.980 line:0%
believing that the world is vast,

00:22:22.040 --> 00:22:23.840 line:0%
and it will naturally broaden my mind,

00:22:23.840 --> 00:22:25.770 line:0%
freeing me from worldly troubles.

00:22:27.800 --> 00:22:29.060 line:0%
Once we leave the city,

00:22:29.120 --> 00:22:30.200 line:0%
all the troubles

00:22:30.800 --> 00:22:33.000 line:0%
will have nothing to do with us anymore.

00:22:34.280 --> 00:22:35.960 line:0%
With the sky as our roof and the ground as our bed,

00:22:35.960 --> 00:22:38.090 line:0%
we'll walk on clouds and ride the wind.

00:23:43.200 --> 00:23:44.200 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:23:47.840 --> 00:23:48.760 line:0%
I'm alright.

00:23:49.280 --> 00:23:50.080 line:0%
It's okay.

00:23:50.440 --> 00:23:51.570 line:0%
It's okay.

00:23:57.960 --> 00:23:59.000 line:0%
Your Majesty!

00:24:03.360 --> 00:24:04.160 line:0%
Gua...

00:24:20.010 --> 00:24:21.270 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:24:21.320 --> 00:24:22.850 line:0%
Please take your medicine.

00:24:31.850 --> 00:24:33.510 line:0%
News from the palace says that

00:24:33.680 --> 00:24:35.590 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager's condition has worsened.

00:24:35.590 --> 00:24:37.590 line:0%
It seems that her days are numbered.

00:24:51.360 --> 00:24:52.440 line:0%
If that's the case,

00:24:53.600 --> 00:24:55.600 line:0%
I should personally pay her a visit.

00:25:15.080 --> 00:25:16.080 line:0%
Who is it?

00:25:17.840 --> 00:25:20.970 line:0%
I heard that your condition has worsened, Your Majesty,

00:25:21.320 --> 00:25:23.320 line:0%
and I am deeply concerned.

00:25:24.600 --> 00:25:28.460 line:0%
I've specially come to pay my respects and inquire about your health.

00:25:30.360 --> 00:25:32.390 line:0%
My condition is not serious.

00:25:32.920 --> 00:25:34.840 line:0%
A few days of rest will suffice.

00:25:35.200 --> 00:25:37.440 line:0%
Lord Lai, there's no need to worry.

00:25:37.600 --> 00:25:38.680 line:0%
Just focus on

00:25:38.680 --> 00:25:41.000 line:0%
your duties at court.

00:25:41.800 --> 00:25:44.030 line:0%
Behave yourself,

00:25:44.160 --> 00:25:47.440 line:0%
lest people say you don't know your place.

00:25:48.840 --> 00:25:51.240 line:0%
Your admonition is correct, Your Majesty.

00:25:56.120 --> 00:25:57.200 line:0%
It seems

00:25:58.360 --> 00:25:59.240 line:0%
the news about of your

00:25:59.240 --> 00:26:01.120 line:0%
grave illness

00:26:01.440 --> 00:26:03.240 line:0%
is not unfounded, Your Majesty.

00:26:04.010 --> 00:26:05.010 line:0%
How dare you!

00:26:08.800 --> 00:26:10.290 line:0%
In my presence,

00:26:11.010 --> 00:26:14.550 line:0%
how dare you be so disrespectful?

00:26:14.960 --> 00:26:16.460 line:0%
Don't get angry.

00:26:17.280 --> 00:26:19.040 line:0%
Your life hangs by a thread.

00:26:23.080 --> 00:26:25.540 line:0%
Guards! Guards!

00:26:31.120 --> 00:26:33.360 line:0%
You've come to harm me.

00:26:33.600 --> 00:26:34.970 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:26:35.320 --> 00:26:37.590 line:0%
How could I have such intentions?

00:26:37.920 --> 00:26:39.760 line:0%
This humble servant has always been

00:26:39.760 --> 00:26:41.840 line:0%
loyal and devoted.

00:26:49.800 --> 00:26:51.070 line:0%
Lai Luozhi.

00:26:52.450 --> 00:26:54.850 line:0%
You were born of humble origins.

00:26:56.450 --> 00:26:58.580 line:0%
If it weren't for my patronage,

00:26:59.080 --> 00:27:00.520 line:0%
how could you have achieved

00:27:00.520 --> 00:27:02.440 line:0%
your current wealth and status?

00:27:02.800 --> 00:27:05.480 line:0%
Yet you've harbored treasonous thoughts.

00:27:06.810 --> 00:27:08.610 line:0%
You are truly worse than a beast.

00:27:11.980 --> 00:27:13.750 line:0%
If it weren't for your own

00:27:14.440 --> 00:27:16.330 line:0%
suspicion and jealousy,

00:27:17.090 --> 00:27:18.950 line:0%
being unable to tolerate others,

00:27:19.440 --> 00:27:21.680 line:0%
how could you have met with such retribution today?

00:27:21.680 --> 00:27:24.860 line:0%
I can face heaven and earth with a clear conscience.

00:27:24.920 --> 00:27:26.080 line:0%
I have no guilt in my heart,

00:27:26.080 --> 00:27:28.040 line:0%
and I have not failed the Cang State!

00:27:28.040 --> 00:27:30.190 line:0%
How dare you judge me!

00:27:33.010 --> 00:27:35.210 line:0%
What a fine claim of a clear conscience.

00:27:35.920 --> 00:27:37.320 line:0%
Then do you remember

00:27:37.960 --> 00:27:39.490 line:0%
Consort Shu whom you framed

00:27:39.850 --> 00:27:42.310 line:0%
and drove to her death?

00:27:44.890 --> 00:27:46.150 line:0%
Consort Shu?

00:27:49.560 --> 00:27:51.200 line:0%
Who are you really?

00:27:52.120 --> 00:27:54.120 line:0%
What is your relationship with her?

00:27:54.480 --> 00:27:55.400 line:0%
Indeed.

00:27:58.080 --> 00:27:59.810 line:0%
In this vast imperial palace,

00:28:00.640 --> 00:28:01.560 line:0%
who would remember

00:28:01.560 --> 00:28:03.480 line:0%
a woman offered by a neighboring country,

00:28:03.480 --> 00:28:04.240 line:0%
a living,

00:28:04.240 --> 00:28:06.640 line:0%
breathing consort who was driven to death?

00:28:07.680 --> 00:28:08.520 line:0%
Sure enough,

00:28:10.360 --> 00:28:11.960 line:0%
even fewer would remember

00:28:13.840 --> 00:28:15.700 line:0%
her child.

00:28:16.000 --> 00:28:16.840 line:0%
Luozhi.

00:28:18.680 --> 00:28:19.880 line:0%
You must remember,

00:28:21.160 --> 00:28:24.140 line:0%
it's Zhou Xu who's going to kill your mother.

00:28:24.680 --> 00:28:26.140 line:0%
Now that your father died,

00:28:27.000 --> 00:28:28.080 line:0%
in this entire palace,

00:28:28.080 --> 00:28:28.840 line:0%
there's no longer

00:28:28.840 --> 00:28:30.640 line:0%
a way for the two of us to survive.

00:28:31.440 --> 00:28:32.920 line:0%
The Empress and

00:28:32.920 --> 00:28:34.250 line:0%
the Zhou clan behind her

00:28:34.320 --> 00:28:35.880 line:0%
have absolute power.

00:28:36.700 --> 00:28:37.600 line:0%
They will not

00:28:37.600 --> 00:28:39.120 line:0%
allow you to live.

00:28:46.260 --> 00:28:47.490 line:0%
But don't be afraid.

00:28:48.600 --> 00:28:50.320 line:0%
I will protect you.

00:28:51.990 --> 00:28:53.360 line:0%
Even if I die,

00:28:55.160 --> 00:28:57.080 line:0%
I will make sure you survive.

00:29:01.440 --> 00:29:03.000 line:0%
I'll trade my life

00:29:04.280 --> 00:29:06.120 line:0%
for your chance to live, Son.

00:29:07.880 --> 00:29:08.980 line:0%
Luozhi.

00:29:09.640 --> 00:29:11.240 line:0%
You must survive.

00:29:11.500 --> 00:29:13.310 line:0%
You must live on,

00:29:14.470 --> 00:29:16.980 line:0%
to reclaim everything that belongs to you.

00:29:17.690 --> 00:29:18.900 line:0%
Do you understand?

00:29:20.200 --> 00:29:21.620 line:0%
Do you understand?

00:29:24.610 --> 00:29:25.700 line:0%
Luozhi...

00:29:26.240 --> 00:29:28.170 line:0%
The wet nurse traded her son's life

00:29:28.730 --> 00:29:30.420 line:0%
for mine.

00:29:30.890 --> 00:29:32.940 line:0%
From then on, I became Lai Luozhi

00:29:33.680 --> 00:29:35.900 line:0%
and lived with the wet nurse's twin daughters,

00:29:35.900 --> 00:29:37.340 line:0%
relying on each other.

00:30:02.230 --> 00:30:03.950 line:0%
Mother!

00:30:05.410 --> 00:30:08.780 line:0%
People laugh at moths flying into the fire,

00:30:09.840 --> 00:30:12.010 line:0%
unaware they are mayflies!

00:30:15.600 --> 00:30:17.320 line:0%
Mother!

00:30:24.800 --> 00:30:26.160 line:0%
After my mother died,

00:30:27.100 --> 00:30:28.240 line:0%
you, the high and mighty

00:30:28.240 --> 00:30:29.640 line:0%
Grand Empress Dowager, thought

00:30:29.640 --> 00:30:30.520 line:0%
this was nothing more than

00:30:30.520 --> 00:30:32.100 line:0%
a harem scandal.

00:30:32.200 --> 00:30:33.080 line:0%
You ordered the palace

00:30:33.080 --> 00:30:35.080 line:0%
not to discuss this matter anymore.

00:30:35.810 --> 00:30:37.320 line:0%
It was also because of this

00:30:37.480 --> 00:30:38.160 line:0%
that the maid who came to the Cang State

00:30:38.160 --> 00:30:39.440 line:0%
with my mother,

00:30:39.440 --> 00:30:40.480 line:0%
my wet nurse,

00:30:41.320 --> 00:30:43.520 line:0%
managed to evade everyone's attention

00:30:44.960 --> 00:30:46.800 line:0%
and take me out of the palace.

00:30:47.960 --> 00:30:48.760 line:0%
So

00:30:49.800 --> 00:30:50.720 line:0%
back then,

00:30:52.840 --> 00:30:54.280 line:0%
in the ruins,

00:30:55.330 --> 00:30:58.020 line:0%
that charred body of a boy...

00:31:14.520 --> 00:31:16.000 line:0%
The wet nurse's son

00:31:17.040 --> 00:31:18.640 line:0%
was right about my age.

00:31:19.800 --> 00:31:21.000 line:0%
He voluntarily

00:31:22.120 --> 00:31:24.120 line:0%
walked into that fire instead of me.

00:31:26.720 --> 00:31:27.640 line:0%
Madness.

00:31:30.560 --> 00:31:32.130 line:0%
This is pure madness.

00:31:33.160 --> 00:31:34.120 line:0%
All of this

00:31:36.480 --> 00:31:38.240 line:0%
is thanks to you.

00:31:39.040 --> 00:31:40.080 line:0%
You are the cause,

00:31:41.090 --> 00:31:42.800 line:0%
so it should be me

00:31:43.720 --> 00:31:45.850 line:0%
who repays you with this consequence.

00:31:47.120 --> 00:31:48.560 line:0%
What do you want to do?

00:31:50.680 --> 00:31:52.640 line:0%
Your life is coming to an end now,

00:31:53.640 --> 00:31:55.970 line:0%
and that young emperor is still not of age.

00:31:57.040 --> 00:31:58.630 line:0%
I think this empire

00:31:59.920 --> 00:32:01.450 line:0%
should be handed over to me,

00:32:04.230 --> 00:32:06.120 line:0%
his uncle.

00:32:14.400 --> 00:32:16.600 line:0%
This throne was mine in the first place.

00:32:17.350 --> 00:32:19.240 line:0%
Only by my ascension can we better continue

00:32:19.240 --> 00:32:21.040 line:0%
the bloodline of the Xiao family.

00:32:21.040 --> 00:32:22.640 line:0%
My father's spirit in heaven

00:32:23.760 --> 00:32:25.080 line:0%
would also feel gratified

00:32:25.080 --> 00:32:26.610 line:0%
on behalf of our ancestors.

00:32:27.920 --> 00:32:29.480 line:0%
Please write

00:32:30.840 --> 00:32:33.240 line:0%
the abdication edict now, Your Majesty.

00:32:36.280 --> 00:32:38.000 line:0%
Abdication edict?

00:32:41.040 --> 00:32:42.840 line:0%
Wishful thinking.

00:32:46.900 --> 00:32:48.060 line:0%
Think about it.

00:32:49.760 --> 00:32:51.620 line:0%
My sister Yong'an

00:32:52.040 --> 00:32:53.600 line:0%
is still imprisoned.

00:32:54.400 --> 00:32:55.660 line:0%
And as for Prince Xian,

00:32:55.840 --> 00:32:57.150 line:0%
it's time to arrange

00:32:57.720 --> 00:32:59.800 line:0%
a good place for him to go, too.

00:33:06.720 --> 00:33:08.280 line:0%
You dare!

00:33:09.840 --> 00:33:11.680 line:0%
I only became the regent

00:33:12.720 --> 00:33:13.960 line:0%
because you fully supported me,

00:33:13.960 --> 00:33:15.560 line:0%
right, Your Majesty?

00:33:16.320 --> 00:33:17.800 line:0%
The evidence of Yong'an's treason by supporting the army

00:33:17.800 --> 00:33:19.080 line:0%
is overwhelming.

00:33:20.040 --> 00:33:21.080 line:0%
From Minister Zhang,

00:33:21.080 --> 00:33:22.040 line:0%
I can also easily dig up

00:33:22.040 --> 00:33:23.360 line:0%
a crime to imprison Prince Xian.

00:33:23.360 --> 00:33:24.920 line:0%
It would be painless.

00:33:26.960 --> 00:33:28.560 line:0%
As for what will happen next,

00:33:30.730 --> 00:33:32.040 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:33:33.360 --> 00:33:35.320 line:0%
can you really not think of it?

00:33:46.280 --> 00:33:47.080 line:0%
I

00:33:48.070 --> 00:33:50.040 line:0%
entered the palace at 14.

00:33:50.320 --> 00:33:51.160 line:0%
My entire life

00:33:51.920 --> 00:33:54.890 line:0%
has been spent in fights and struggles.

00:33:56.900 --> 00:33:58.410 line:0%
But in the end,

00:33:59.040 --> 00:34:02.200 line:0%
I still let my guard down.

00:34:03.000 --> 00:34:05.980 line:0%
You could have waited until after my death.

00:34:06.080 --> 00:34:07.640 line:0%
Any kind of edict

00:34:07.680 --> 00:34:10.680 line:0%
could have been fabricated at your will, couldn't it?

00:34:13.430 --> 00:34:14.720 line:0%
You're just

00:34:14.720 --> 00:34:16.850 line:0%
someone seeking fame and reputation.

00:34:16.880 --> 00:34:18.360 line:0%
You just want to legitimately

00:34:18.360 --> 00:34:20.430 line:0%
ascend to this position, that's all.

00:34:22.030 --> 00:34:24.240 line:0%
The day of the Grand Court Assembly

00:34:25.360 --> 00:34:27.760 line:0%
is also the death anniversary of my mother.

00:34:27.880 --> 00:34:28.950 line:0%
It's also the final deadline

00:34:28.950 --> 00:34:30.280 line:0%
I've set for you.

00:34:30.510 --> 00:34:31.320 line:0%
By then,

00:34:31.600 --> 00:34:32.950 line:0%
my mother will witness her son

00:34:32.950 --> 00:34:34.620 line:0%
return openly and righteously.

00:34:34.620 --> 00:34:35.880 line:0%
Her death anniversary

00:34:36.030 --> 00:34:38.630 line:0%
will be the day her child ascends to the throne!

00:35:14.250 --> 00:35:15.240 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:35:15.970 --> 00:35:18.040 line:0%
I know what you're up to.

00:35:40.730 --> 00:35:41.790 line:0%
Counting the days,

00:35:42.590 --> 00:35:43.990 line:0%
she should have arrived.

00:36:01.270 --> 00:36:02.760 line:0%
[Nanlang State]

00:36:02.920 --> 00:36:05.050 line:0%
This is the boundary stone of Nanlang.

00:36:05.320 --> 00:36:06.650 line:0%
We've finally arrived.

00:36:11.280 --> 00:36:12.080 line:0%
Master.

00:36:12.120 --> 00:36:13.080 line:0%
Lord Chen?

00:36:19.450 --> 00:36:20.360 line:0%
My disciple.

00:36:19.620 --> 00:36:21.840 line:0%
[Nanlang State]

00:36:20.560 --> 00:36:22.240 line:0%
I received your urgent letter

00:36:22.240 --> 00:36:24.280 line:0%
and calculated that you should have arrived by now.

00:36:24.280 --> 00:36:26.640 line:0%
I didn't expect you to be even quicker.

00:36:27.080 --> 00:36:27.880 line:0%
Master.

00:36:28.000 --> 00:36:29.040 line:0%
Now, Xiang'an City

00:36:29.040 --> 00:36:30.800 line:0%
is crawling with Lai Luozhi's pawns.

00:36:30.800 --> 00:36:31.640 line:0%
For safety's sake,

00:36:31.640 --> 00:36:33.640 line:0%
we didn't dare to stop along the way.

00:36:34.260 --> 00:36:35.770 line:0%
[Nanlang State]

00:36:38.440 --> 00:36:40.400 line:0%
The information you want to know

00:36:40.560 --> 00:36:42.320 line:0%
is indeed not simple.

00:36:47.400 --> 00:36:48.530 line:0%
So Xing,

00:36:48.580 --> 00:36:49.680 line:0%
you'd already asked Lord Chen

00:36:49.680 --> 00:36:50.960 line:0%
to secretly come to Nanlang

00:36:50.180 --> 00:36:51.940 line:0%
[Lai Luozhi's mother's tombstone only bears the name Bi Luo]

00:36:51.040 --> 00:36:52.680 line:0%
to investigate Lai Luozhi's background.

00:36:52.620 --> 00:36:56.380 line:0%
[Bi Luo]

00:36:52.880 --> 00:36:54.480 line:0%
I heard from Chuichui before

00:36:54.640 --> 00:36:55.960 line:0%
that on the tombstone of Lai Luozhi's mother,

00:36:55.960 --> 00:36:57.440 line:0%
there was only the name Bi Luo,

00:36:57.440 --> 00:36:58.770 line:0%
but no family surname.

00:36:58.960 --> 00:37:00.910 line:0%
So I asked Yeyun to investigate.

00:37:01.080 --> 00:37:02.600 line:0%
On the unburnt paper offerings,

00:37:02.600 --> 00:37:03.680 line:0%
there were drawings of conch shells.

00:37:03.680 --> 00:37:05.560 line:0%
On the joss paper used in ancestral worship in the Cang State,

00:37:05.560 --> 00:37:07.160 line:0%
such patterns are rarely seen.

00:37:07.160 --> 00:37:08.400 line:0%
However, I've heard that in Nanlang,

00:37:08.400 --> 00:37:09.600 line:0%
there are people who worship conch shells.

00:37:09.600 --> 00:37:10.880 line:0%
Yeyun also found

00:37:10.880 --> 00:37:12.560 line:0%
traces of spilled ox blood on the ground.

00:37:12.560 --> 00:37:13.760 line:0%
Using ox blood for sacrifice

00:37:13.760 --> 00:37:15.890 line:0%
is also precisely a custom of Nanlang.

00:37:18.550 --> 00:37:19.350 line:0%
Master.

00:37:20.440 --> 00:37:22.520 line:0%
So Bi Luo was actually Consort Shu,

00:37:22.520 --> 00:37:24.800 line:0%
whom Nanlang offered to the late emperor of the Cang State?

00:37:24.800 --> 00:37:25.800 line:0%
That's correct.

00:37:25.960 --> 00:37:27.540 line:0%
However, this Bi Luo

00:37:27.600 --> 00:37:28.400 line:0%
had a part of her past

00:37:28.400 --> 00:37:30.240 line:0%
that is unknown to others.

00:37:30.240 --> 00:37:33.080 line:0%
I'm afraid even her own son

00:37:33.080 --> 00:37:34.340 line:0%
doesn't know about it.

00:38:14.520 --> 00:38:16.780 line:0%
After tomorrow's Grand Court Assembly,

00:38:17.520 --> 00:38:19.160 line:0%
everything will be settled.

00:38:20.520 --> 00:38:22.320 line:0%
After waiting for so many years,

00:38:23.920 --> 00:38:25.040 line:0%
if she obediently

00:38:26.120 --> 00:38:27.920 line:0%
hands over the throne tomorrow,

00:38:42.980 --> 00:38:45.110 line:0%
there'll still be something missing.

00:38:58.500 --> 00:38:59.690 line:0%
[Cangming Hall]

00:39:00.270 --> 00:39:04.690 line:0%
Long live the Emperor!

00:39:14.320 --> 00:39:17.870 line:0%
The envoy from Xichen presents tribute.

00:39:18.080 --> 00:39:21.830 line:0%
The envoy from Nanlang presents tribute.

00:39:36.320 --> 00:39:37.200 line:0%
Today,

00:39:37.420 --> 00:39:39.010 line:0%
all states have come to pay tribute,

00:39:39.010 --> 00:39:40.810 line:0%
joining in this grand occasion.

00:39:41.040 --> 00:39:43.680 line:0%
May we foster friendly relations between states,

00:39:43.680 --> 00:39:46.080 line:0%
and bring peace to all corners of the world.

00:39:47.960 --> 00:39:49.680 line:0%
With a strong foundation, the state will be at peace.

00:39:49.680 --> 00:39:51.740 line:0%
We should start anew with the people,

00:39:52.120 --> 00:39:54.160 line:0%
and unite the hearts of all under heaven.

00:39:54.160 --> 00:39:56.200 line:0%
Only then can we shine for a thousand years.

00:39:56.200 --> 00:39:57.660 line:0%
To maintain longevity,

00:39:57.960 --> 00:39:59.640 line:0%
select only the worthy for office,

00:39:59.640 --> 00:40:02.100 line:0%
and the world will naturally be set in order.

00:40:05.780 --> 00:40:07.260 line:0%
To unite all under heaven

00:40:07.480 --> 00:40:08.990 line:0%
and maintain longevity

00:40:09.080 --> 00:40:11.280 line:0%
is the responsibility of a great state.

00:40:13.640 --> 00:40:16.520 line:0%
Greetings, Your Majesty!

00:40:16.600 --> 00:40:19.960 line:0%
Long live the Grand Empress Dowager!

00:40:26.640 --> 00:40:28.280 line:0%
The Court Assembly is a grand occasion.

00:40:28.280 --> 00:40:29.740 line:0%
The whole world rejoices.

00:40:29.760 --> 00:40:31.560 line:0%
Her Majesty is delighted

00:40:31.680 --> 00:40:33.280 line:0%
and has recovered from her illness.

00:40:33.280 --> 00:40:35.740 line:0%
She hereby wants to bestow a feast upon all court officials.

00:40:35.740 --> 00:40:38.900 line:0%
Thank you for your great kindness, Your Majesty.

00:40:39.600 --> 00:40:41.080 line:0%
Your Majesty, you've just recovered.

00:40:41.080 --> 00:40:42.720 line:0%
You shouldn't overexert yourself.

00:40:42.720 --> 00:40:43.720 line:0%
If your old illness relapses,

00:40:43.720 --> 00:40:45.200 line:0%
that would be terrible.

00:40:45.870 --> 00:40:47.800 line:0%
Your Majesty, do you have an edict

00:40:47.960 --> 00:40:49.920 line:0%
that's to be announced at the Grand Court Assembly

00:40:49.920 --> 00:40:51.280 line:0%
to all the officials?

00:40:51.280 --> 00:40:52.280 line:0%
Lord Lai.

00:40:52.560 --> 00:40:55.490 line:0%
You really are getting more and more disrespectful.

00:40:57.640 --> 00:41:00.080 line:0%
Thanks to your reminder, Mr. Lai.

00:41:00.200 --> 00:41:02.400 line:0%
I do have something to announce.

00:41:03.120 --> 00:41:06.920 line:0%
A few days ago, I suddenly fell ill with a severe ailment

00:41:06.960 --> 00:41:08.880 line:0%
and had no time for court affairs.

00:41:09.240 --> 00:41:10.560 line:0%
Many matters

00:41:10.640 --> 00:41:14.160 line:0%
were temporarily entrusted to the Imperial Investigation Department.

00:41:14.160 --> 00:41:17.120 line:0%
Mr. Lai has been working very hard.

00:41:17.720 --> 00:41:18.520 line:0%
Now,

00:41:18.600 --> 00:41:20.720 line:0%
I have fully recovered.

00:41:20.960 --> 00:41:23.080 line:0%
His Majesty is also studying

00:41:23.120 --> 00:41:25.520 line:0%
the art of governance with the Grand Tutor.

00:41:25.840 --> 00:41:27.100 line:0%
From this day forward,

00:41:27.120 --> 00:41:29.640 line:0%
Mr. Lai, you no longer need to perform

00:41:29.640 --> 00:41:31.080 line:0%
the duties of regent.

00:41:31.240 --> 00:41:34.120 line:0%
You are relieved of your burdensome duties at the Imperial Investigation Department.

00:41:34.120 --> 00:41:36.800 line:0%
Go and rest peacefully.